{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^You defeated him. I’ll make sure to pay you as soon as I can. ","#","^speaker: Ryker ","/#","#","^portrait: ryker ","/#","#","^layout: right ","/#","#","^trigger: player","/#","\n","^Don’t worry about it. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^You betrayed me. I picked you for that bounty because you’re supposed to be heartless. ","#","^speaker: Talon ","/#","#","^portrait: talon ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^Well people can surprise you. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^They sure can. I even have one surprise for you. ","#","^speaker: Talon ","/#","#","^portrait: talon ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^What? ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","^I have put up the largest bounty on you that has ever been seen. ","#","^speaker: Talon ","/#","#","^portrait: talon ","/#","#","^layout: right","/#","\n","^Your life is going to be hell from this point forward.","\n","^Goodbye Talon. ","#","^speaker: Ace ","/#","#","^portrait: ace ","/#","#","^layout: left","/#","\n","#","^scene: lobby","/#",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}